	(title_block (title "MeshSat Field Kit carrier - PCB-B COMPUTE") (date "2026-09-02") (rev "A") (company "MeshSat") (comment 1 "Phase B2 schematic (B12: no X1202, three rails from PCB-A), generated by tools/gen_sch_b.py. Netlist style: every pin carries a stub and a net label.") (comment 2 "MESHSAT-709. B11: +5V from the PCB-A module-rail boost over J_5V_MOD (VH); the X1202 XH output is only a sense line (X1202_5V to J_AB1.12) that enables that boost. FE1.1s hub on internal regulators; TPS2065C x2 + TPS22810 x4 switches (B4: LoRa and RockBLOCK channels at 2 A for the T-Beam 1W and 9704 bursts); INA219 per channel; PCA9555 EN/FAULT; both Pi UARTs to the RockBLOCK site via JP3/JP4."))
